    <briefdescription>
<para>GPU-callable functor that finds characteristic feet for physical-space advection with foot-finding in pseudo-physical <formula id="21">$ (X_{pC}, Y_{pC}) $</formula> space. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The advection field is expressed in physical Cartesian coordinates and converted to pseudo-physical space. Foot-finding integrates the characteristic equation in pseudo-physical space. Constructed by <ref refid="classpolar__foot__finder__details_1_1ElementwisePhysicalAdvPseudoPhysicalFootFinderMem" kindref="compound">ElementwisePhysicalAdvPseudoPhysicalFootFinderMem</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
